DAMON analysis module
---------------------

src/cgprofile/_damon/damon_analysis.py
  Byte copy of scripts/damon-analysis/lib/damon_analysis.py (DAMON sysfs
  control and hot/warm/cold classification), kept equal to its source by
  tests/test_damon_vendor.py.
  SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT.

  Provenance: first-party code written by the project owner around the kernel
  DAMON sysfs interface (/sys/kernel/mm/damon/admin). It contains no copied
  `damo` source; the separate `damo` tool is only invoked as a subprocess
  (`damo report sysinfo`). The file carried `SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0`
  until 2026-11-05; the owner confirmed authorship and the header was changed
  to MIT (backlog CP-51, docs/LICENSING.md at the repository root).

No third-party source is vendored in this wheel.
